te each leaf law, the exact per-stage not-reached causes, and the parent composition, with zero production cost. What is NOT migrated is the REAL observation, still reconstructed per evaluation rather than materialized once under its subject identity — that is this row's replacement plan, owned by the semantic-result materialization slice, and its cost trigger is separate from the lane's semantic trigger. The resolve figure above is harness acquisition and is NOT part of the witness eval figure; the partition figure is a third universe again and the two are never summed. Local recipe: claim_batch --source-root dag --source-root src/v2 --entry src/v2/test/claim/long/direct_rust_door_production_group_test.dag --functions direct_rust_door_production_group_closing_expectation_holds"

